{% extends "quarterly_deep_dive/llm_prompts/base_prompt.j2" %}

{# Specific context for the main narrative of Section 4 #}
{% set output_format_description = "a coherent narrative paragraph (or potentially two short paragraphs) summarizing the analysis of CVSS score distributions, suitable for the main body text. Use Markdown for clarity (e.g., simple bolding) if helpful." %}

{% block task_instructions %}
Synthesize the provided chart insights, callouts, and data summaries for "{{ section_title }}" into a flowing narrative text.
Your narrative should describe the key characteristics of the CVSS base score distribution observed during the reporting period. Focus on:
1. Overall distribution trends (e.g., where do most scores fall?).
2. Significant differences in score distributions between major vulnerability categories (e.g., which categories pose inherently higher risks based on typical CVSS scores?).
3. Any notable clustering, spread, or outliers identified in the data.
Integrate the key points highlighted in the callouts. Aim for 3-6 sentences. You may use simple Markdown (like **bold**) for emphasis if appropriate.
{% endblock task_instructions %}

{% block data_context %}
Section Key: {{ data_context_payload.section_key | default('section_4_cvss_dist') }}

Chart Insights Generated for this Section:
{% for chart_id, insight in data_context_payload.chart_insights_in_section.items() %}
- Insight ({{ chart_id }}): {{ insight }}
{% else %}
- No specific chart insights provided.
{% endfor %}

Callouts Generated for this Section:
{% for callout_key, callout_text in data_context_payload.callouts_in_section.items() %}
- {{ callout_key | replace("_", " ") | title }}: {{ callout_text }}
{% else %}
- No callouts generated for this section.
{% endfor %}

Data Summaries for Charts in this Section:
{% for chart_id, summary in data_context_payload.charts_data_summaries_in_section.items() %}
--- Data Summary: {{ chart_id }} ---
{{ summary }}
--- End Summary ---
{% else %}
- No chart data summaries provided.
{% endfor %}
{% endblock data_context %}
